tensorflow-b300

This is an unofficial build of TensorFlow for NVIDIA B300 GPUs. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by or supported by Google, the TensorFlow project or NVIDIA.

The build scripts, Containerfiles and smoke test in this repository are licensed under the
Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE).

TensorFlow is licensed under the Apache License 2.0. The wheel published on the Releases page
is built from unmodified TensorFlow source at commit 5693b4a7feaff77f23af8a8218cd6e8e7aa2a7ca
and keeps TensorFlow's own LICENSE and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt.

The wheel does not contain NVIDIA CUDA, cuDNN or NCCL libraries. They are installed separately,
either from NVIDIA's pip packages or from the NVIDIA base image, under NVIDIA's own license terms.

The Containerfiles build on nvcr.io/nvidia/cuda-dl-base, which is pulled directly from NVIDIA's
NGC registry by whoever builds the image and is subject to NVIDIA's license for that image.
No NVIDIA container image is redistributed by this repository.
